---
// Development shell only. Replace after owner-approved creative comparison.
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <meta name="description" content="Cakeopedia Austin website development preview." />
    <title>Cakeopedia Austin — development preview</title>
    <style>
      :root { color-scheme: light; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; color: #292e28; background: #f8f5ee; }
      * { box-sizing: border-box; }
      body { margin: 0; }
      a { color: inherit; text-underline-offset: .25em; }
      a:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #365c46; outline-offset: 6px; }
      .skip { position: absolute; top: -5rem; left: 1rem; padding: 1rem; background: white; }
      .skip:focus { top: 1rem; }
      header, main, footer { width: min(70rem, calc(100% - 3rem)); margin-inline: auto; }
      header { padding-block: 2rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #b8bdb0; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
      .brand { font: 1.5rem Georgia, serif; }
      .status { font-size: .8rem; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; }
      main { padding-block: clamp(3rem, 12vw, 9rem); }
      h1 { max-width: 14ch; font: 400 clamp(2.75rem, 8vw, 6rem)/1.04 Georgia, serif; letter-spacing: -.035em; margin: 1rem 0 2rem; }
      p { max-width: 42rem; line-height: 1.7; }
      .note { border-left: 2px solid #365c46; padding-left: 1.5rem; margin-top: 3rem; }
      footer { border-top: 1px solid #b8bdb0; padding-block: 1.5rem; font-size: .875rem; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
    <header><span class="brand">Cakeopedia Austin</span><span class="status">Development preview</span></header>
    <main id="main" tabindex="-1">
      <p class="status">Austin, Texas · From-scratch baking</p>
      <h1>A home for her creations.</h1>
      <p>The portfolio, menu and enquiry experience are being built around the baker’s genuine work. This is a development shell, not the finished website.</p>
      <div class="note"><p>Online enquiries and payments are not enabled here.</p><p>For the existing business, visit <a href="https://www.instagram.com/cakeopedia.austin/">Cakeopedia on Instagram</a>.</p></div>
    </main>
    <footer>Photography, menu, identity and fulfilment details await owner approval.</footer>
  </body>
</html>
